{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the EpiDexa Racing Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EpiDexa Racing is an arcade racing game centered around time trials and competitive multiplayer. It\u2019s designed for both quick fun and serious challenge. Easy to play with keyboard or controller \u2013 but mastering the tracks will push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/extras/90e0de67b24ec0f8a0cbf2cab3ec0a19.poster.avif?t=1761321260\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/extras/90e0de67b24ec0f8a0cbf2cab3ec0a19.webm?t=1761321260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/extras/90e0de67b24ec0f8a0cbf2cab3ec0a19.mp4?t=1761321260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 8 mountain tracks<br>\u2022 4 preconfigured vehicles<br>\u2022 Available modes: Singleplayer, Multiplayer, and Private Match<br>\u2022 Full support for leaderboards and multiplayer scores</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/extras/b0d762c83e5c6123ddcbee289acd1fc6.poster.avif?t=1761321260\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/extras/b0d762c83e5c6123ddcbee289acd1fc6.webm?t=1761321260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/extras/b0d762c83e5c6123ddcbee289acd1fc6.mp4?t=1761321260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-based racing without frustration</strong><br>EpiDexa Racing is all about precision and fairness. In the standard modes, cars can\u2019t collide \u2013 so no other player can ruin your run with unfair behavior. Thanks to finely tuned controls, every corner, drift, and millisecond counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cars differ only in appearance \u2013 handling is identical. This means newcomers have the same chance to win as experienced players, keeping the competition fair and purely skill-based.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer</strong> \u2013 Classic time trial mode: improve your skills, earn bronze, silver, and gold medals, and climb the global leaderboards.<br><strong>Public Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Compete against players from all over the world and improve your driver rating.<br><strong>Private Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Create your own lobby and challenge your friends to find out who\u2019s the fastest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play your way \u2013 with precise keyboard or controller handling.<br>\u2022 Race against your own ghost to improve your consistency and perfect your runs.<br>\u2022 Global leaderboards to compare your skills with the world.<br>\u2022 Dedicated servers \u2013 no splitscreen, no host advantage, just pure racing.<br>\u2022 Private multiplayer lobbies for you and your friends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113490?t=1761321260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/493bd7b25b454bb10fae1a9c3fb3b4259b8e4123/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761321260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/e533af53f1020ae168f301a4eb8878c44c88ec51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761321260","capsule_imagev5":"h