ompare your skills with the world.<br>\u2022 Dedicated servers \u2013 no splitscreen, no host advantage, just pure racing.<br>\u2022 Private multiplayer lobbies for you and your friends.</p>","developers":["VENAKOVI"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4052120","name":"EpiDexa Racing"},"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113490/1a97761bbaa20110da2af0bab55badecd7345d7d/header.jpg?t=1761321260","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113490/496005337/4fa2001a03f4e480d43b5efcb192585c0aa82cee/1761320705/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761321256","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113490/496005337/4fa2001a03f4e480d43b5efcb192585c0aa82cee/1761320705/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761321256","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113490/496005337/4fa2001a03f4e480d43b5efcb192585c0aa82cee/1761320705/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761321256","id":257222181,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222181/movie480.mp4?t=1761321256","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222181/movie_max.mp4?t=1761321256"},"name":"EpiDexa Racing Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222181/29489d34f101075c57d6527f4f0e0db5d2a4a6d6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761321256","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222181/movie480.webm?t=1761321256","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222181/movie_max.webm?t=1761321256"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113490/1317692550/d19396387e5fbf1ca05826d20565ab527710e27d/1760520855/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761321258","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113490/1317692550/d19396387e5fbf1ca05826d20565ab527710e27d/1760520855/dash_h264.mpd?t=176132